DEFINITIONS
-----------
"Software" refers to OffSec Assistant and all associated files, documentation,
configuration, commands, agents, templates, and tools contained in this repository.

"Commercial Use" means any use intended for commercial advantage or monetary
compensation, including but not limited to: incorporating the Software into a
commercial product or service, offering the Software as part of a paid security
consultancy or managed service, reselling or sublicensing the Software, or using
the Software to generate revenue directly or indirectly without prior written
authorization from the copyright holder.

"Authorized Security Testing" means security assessments, penetration tests,
vulnerability research, or similar activities conducted with explicit, documented,
written authorization from the system owner and within the scope defined in that
authorization.

